#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:51
msgid ""
"Chalk comes with an easy to use composable API where you just chain and "
"nest the styles you want."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:96
msgid "Easily define your own themes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:108
msgid ""
"Take advantage of console.log [string "
"substitution](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/console.html#console_console_log_data_args):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:117
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:119
msgid "chalk.`<style>[.<style>...](string, [string...])`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:121
msgid "Example: `chalk.red.bold.underline('Hello', 'world');`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:123
msgid ""
"Chain [styles](#styles) and call the last one as a method with a string "
"argument. Order doesn't matter, and later styles take precedent in case "
"of a conflict. This simply means that `chalk.red.yellow.green` is "
"equivalent to `chalk.green`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:125
msgid "Multiple arguments will be separated by space."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:127
msgid "chalk.enabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:129
msgid ""
"Color support is automatically detected, as is the level (see "
"`chalk.level`). However, if you'd like to simply enable/disable Chalk, "
"you can do so via the `.enabled` property."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:131
msgid ""
"Chalk is enabled by default unless explicitly disabled via the "
"constructor or `chalk.level` is `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:133 ../../source/chalk_readme.md:143
msgid "If you need to change this in a reusable module, create a new instance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:139
msgid "chalk.level"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:141
msgid ""
"Color support is automatically detected, but you can override it by "
"setting the `level` property. You should however only do this in your own"
" code as it applies globally to all Chalk consumers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:149
msgid "Levels are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:151
msgid "All colors disabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:152
