msgid "Truecolor support (16 million colors)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:156
msgid "chalk.supportsColor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:158
msgid ""
"Detect whether the terminal [supports color](https://github.com/chalk"
"/supports-color). Used internally and handled for you, but exposed for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:160
msgid ""
"Can be overridden by the user with the flags `--color` and `--no-color`. "
"For situations where using `--color` is not possible, add the environment"
" variable `FORCE_COLOR=1` to forcefully enable color or `FORCE_COLOR=0` "
"to forcefully disable. The use of `FORCE_COLOR` overrides all other color"
" support checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:162
msgid ""
"Explicit 256/Truecolor mode can be enabled using the `--color=256` and "
"`--color=16m` flags, respectively."
msgstr ""

