#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:283
msgid "Origin story"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/chalk_readme.md:285
msgid ""
"[colors.js](https://github.com/Marak/colors.js) used to be the most "
"popular string styling module, but it has serious deficiencies like "
"extending `String.prototype` which causes all kinds of "
"[problems](https://github.com/yeoman/yo/issues/68) and the package is "
"unmaintained. Although there are other packages, they either do too much "
"or not enough. Chalk is a clean and focused alternative."
msgstr ""

